abstract: >-
  Reproducibility archive for the journal extension: exact fixed-demand radio-allocation solver,
  continuous-power mathematical lower reference, offline finite-horizon exact references on aged
  and current beam gain, the frozen confirmatory campaign (400 execution units, 2,400 rows, paired
  seeds 50002-50021), final analysis, deterministic figure generation and integrity records.
